[1323.02345, "o", "regenerated /app/bloat_memo.md\r\n"]
[1323.030461, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@89f5f31a11f9:/app# "]
[1323.030856, "o", "grep -E 'T-75 |T-102 |T-108 |T-96 |T-05 |T-130 |T-10 ' /app/bloat_memo.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[1323.034208, "o", "T-130 is STALE_STATISTICS because last_analyzed is 40 days before audit date 2026-09-01, which meets the >=30 staleness rule, and the legacy days_since_analyze field is ignored; computed ratio 0.40 from dead_pages 160 / total_pages 400 would exceed tightened small cap 0.35, but qualifying hold ticket CH-2210 suppresses bloat, so stale stats remains; export size_class medium ignored; computed size_class is small from total_pages 400.\r\nT-10 is STALE_STATISTICS because last_analyzed is 31 days before audit date 2026-09-01, which meets the >=30 staleness rule, and the legacy days_since_analyze field is ignored; computed ratio 0.21 from dead_pages 210 / total_pages 1000 would exceed tightened large cap 0.10, but approved active reindex with valid_until=2026-09-15 exempts bloat, so stale stats remains; computed size_class is large from total_pages 1000.\r\n"]
[1323.034413, "o", "T-102 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed and rounded half-up ratio 0.36 from dead_pages 144 / total_pages 400 exceeds the small cap 0.35; stats are stale at 30 days, so the cap was tightened from 0.40 to 0.35; export size_class medium ignored; computed size_class is small from total_pages 400.\r\nT-108 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed and rounded half-up ratio 0.41 from dead_pages 207 / total_pages 499 exceeds the small cap 0.40; export size_class large ignored; computed size_class is small from total_pages 499.\r\nT-75 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed and rounded half-up ratio 0.21 from dead_pages 168 / total_pages 800 exceeds the large cap 0.20; export size_class medium ignored; computed size_class is large from total_pages 800.\r\nT-96 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed and rounded half-up ratio 0.21 from dead_pages 205 / total_pages 1000 exceeds the large cap 0.20; export size_class small ignored; computed size_class is large from total_pages 1000.\r\n"]
[1323.034655, "o", "T-05 is BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED because computed and rounded half-up ratio 0.55 from dead_pages 550 / total_pages 1000 exceeds the large cap 0.20; reindex is unapproved because approved=False and valid_until=2026-09-15, not exempt; computed size_class is large from total_pages 1000.\r\n"]
[1323.035017, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@89f5f31a11f9:/app# "]
[1323.035434, "o", "grep 'BLOAT_THRESHOLD_EXCEEDED' /app/bloat_memo.md | grep -vc 'computed size_class is'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
